    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Ready Meals - Methodology'>
      <repository-location derived-from='http://ip-172-31-0-203:8905/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/ReadyMealBefore_After/ReadyMeals-Methodology?rev=' id='ReadyMeals-Methodology' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/ReadyMealBefore_After' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='39500' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='25000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run>Ready Meals are defined as dmart items in categories of: &apos;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#37474f'>Food&apos;, &apos;Sweet Bakery&apos;, &apos;Frozen Convenience / Bakery&apos; , &apos;Ready Meals&apos;, &apos;Prepared F&amp;V / Fresh Herbs&apos;, &apos;Beverages&apos; .</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true'>Information regarding analysis sample:</run>
              <run>
- First &quot;Ready Meal&quot; orders by customers since Jan-22 have been taken into consideration, the overall data includes orders from Jan-20. 
- Control group does not include RM customers.
- Both groups include customers acquired after (incl) &quot;2019-01-01&quot; and before &quot;2023-12-01&quot;(not incl.)

</run>
              <run bold='true'>Control Group Match logic:</run>
              <run>
Control group has been matched with RM customers based on monthly customer maturity. Example: 12 month active RM customers are matched with 12 month active non-RM customers.

</run>
              <run bold='true'>Important note: </run>
              <run>
Naturally control group is bigger than the RM customers, this reflects on customer numbers and order numbers. Deciding factor: Frequency should be taken in to effect when there is enough customer number is present.

</run>
              <run bold='true'>Abbrevations:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#555555'>RM = Ready Meal | CG = Control Group</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='24000' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Ready Meal Analysis</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>This dashboard helps to analyse the performance differences between Ready Meal and non-Ready Meal customers by comparing Frequencies in similar customer maturity months. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Tested arguments:</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f' fontsize='10'>1. Do RM customers increase their frequency after their first RM order?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f' fontsize='10'>2. Can we ensure the increase in frequency is driven by first time RM order vs a natural increase in market frequency (CG)?</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone h='34500' id='6' type-v2='empty' w='98400' x='800' y='64500'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='26' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='98000' id='25' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='24000' id='5' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Ready Meal Analysis</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>This dashboard helps to analyse the performance differences between Ready Meal and non-Ready Meal customers by comparing Frequencies in similar customer maturity months. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Tested arguments:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f' fontsize='10'>1. Do RM customers increase their frequency after their first RM order?</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#1f1f1f' fontsize='10'>2. Can we ensure the increase in frequency is driven by first time RM order vs a natural increase in market frequency (CG)?</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='39500' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='25000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run>Ready Meals are defined as dmart items in categories of: &apos;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#37474f'>Food&apos;, &apos;Sweet Bakery&apos;, &apos;Frozen Convenience / Bakery&apos; , &apos;Ready Meals&apos;, &apos;Prepared F&amp;V / Fresh Herbs&apos;, &apos;Beverages&apos; .</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true'>Information regarding analysis sample:</run>
                    <run>
- First &quot;Ready Meal&quot; orders by customers since Jan-22 have been taken into consideration, the overall data includes orders from Jan-20. 
- Control group does not include RM customers.
- Both groups include customers acquired after (incl) &quot;2019-01-01&quot; and before &quot;2023-12-01&quot;(not incl.)

</run>
                    <run bold='true'>Control Group Match logic:</run>
                    <run>
Control group has been matched with RM customers based on monthly customer maturity. Example: 12 month active RM customers are matched with 12 month active non-RM customers.

</run>
                    <run bold='true'>Important note: </run>
                    <run>
Naturally control group is bigger than the RM customers, this reflects on customer numbers and order numbers. Deciding factor: Frequency should be taken in to effect when there is enough customer number is present.

</run>
                    <run bold='true'>Abbrevations:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#555555'>RM = Ready Meal | CG = Control Group</run>
                  </formatted-text>
